		"description": "<p>As a bonus action, you take on the dragon’s hide stance, shifting your body into your opponents in such a way that you gain resistance to all damage taken while grappling. So long as you are actively grappling another creature, they take half of all damage dealt to you. This includes damage they do to you.</p>",
